    "The park file and sync-off file also pass their all-cycle5% test; the statement that only the interchange reflection-on file passes is overbroad. Lenses and halos individually have3 stable cycles despite their combined file failing due to pools.",
    "Equal LOD1 visibility-mask response with reflection on/off supports a non-reflection workload, but does not prove shading in isolation.",
